# Play test of The Stranded Gull (CIPlay stranded_gull, in a test world 'CI ...'). Points as in its recipe.
island The Stranded Gull
# DEEP 10-25: the hill moved the land's centre (the recipe's save prints the exact offset)
offset -12.18 9.08
expect step 0
expect title The Gull's Safe

# The camp and the deckhand's note
walk -12 -4 to -4 0.6
zone camp
expect step 0
expect message couches and bar stools
read Deckhand's note
expect step 1

# The safe without its key stays shut
open Ship's safe
expect message Locked tight
expect step 1

# The tender: up its boarding ladder, rats, the captain's locker with the key
walk -4 0.6 to 9.5 -8.5
climb 10.66 -10.52 h=0.5
zone aboard
expect message Rats pour out
kill Rat
expect animals Rat 0
expect step 2
open Captain's locker
expect story capkey 1
expect step 3
read Captain's locker

# DEEP 10-25: Lookout Hill at the west end, the navigator's log
zone gullfoot
zone gulltop
expect step 4
read Navigator Ilse Brandt's log
expect step 5

# The angler fish in the sunken stern, then the safe
kill Angler fish
expect step 6
expect animals Angler fish 0
open Ship's safe
expect story capkey 0
expect item Hat_Captain 1
expect done
read Ship's safe
